# PC card team-gunline (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.4, TMODE-19): arm bb (A/A, master again under another name), all 46 teams against master (the aa build). Template: gnprep writes work/team-gunline-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
